# Kayd App — Cline Project Rules

Project: Kayd # update with your actual app description
Stack: React Native / Next.js / Node # update to match your actual stack
Styling: Tailwind / NativeWind # update as needed

# Coding conventions
- Use TypeScript strictly, no implicit any
- Functional components only, no class components
- Keep components small and single-responsibility
- Always handle loading and error states

# Pipeline reminder
- Stage 02 (scaffold) and 05 (review): switch model to Claude Sonnet 4.6
- Stage 03 (implement) and 04 (tests): stay on DeepSeek V3

# Do not
- Do not modify .env files
- Do not install new packages without asking first
- Do not rewrite existing logic unless explicitly asked